(d) the steps taken by Government to spread awareness and information about ration card portability, especially among migrants?

(a) whether it is a fact that since the launch of the Smart Cities Mission in June, 2015, out of the 100 selected cities, only around 25 cities will be able to meet the June, 2023 deadline;
(b) if so, the details thereof; and
(c) the progress, according to the mission guidelines, of the selected cities till date and likely timelines for completion?

